<h3 id="7-when-does-a-deadlock-occur">7. When Does a Deadlock Occur</h3>

<p>Deadlocks are mainly caused by asymmetric thread information — a situation where A waits for B while B is also waiting for A.</p>

<div class="language-objc highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><!-- <td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
